      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَثْغُورٌ</span></b>  <i>Having his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَغْر</span> [or <i>front teeth</i>], (A,) or
<i>his teeth,</i> (IAar, TA,) <i>broken.</i> (IAar, A, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Having his mouth bruised;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْغَرٌ</span></b> .
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A boy (AZ, S) <i>shedding his central
milk-teeth,</i> (AZ, S, K,) or <i>his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَغْر</span> [or <i>front teeth</i>].
(AZ, A, Msb.)

